# patches/uboot/series — quilt-style ordered apply list.
# One filename per line (relative to this dir). '#' = comment, blank lines OK.
# Applied by scripts/apply-series.sh via `git am` (run from the uboot tree).
#
# U-Boot RK3506 SoC support is ALREADY upstream (Jonas Karlman v2 merged into
# 2026.07-rc4); this series holds ONLY the board/DT/defconfig + SFC delta.
# Consolidated 2026-06-17 into 2 patches (board + SFC) from explore/uboot
# (base 5ca1a73c); the earlier 4-patch additive series squashed.

# Board support: AES RK3506B defconfig + DT entries (rk3506.dtsi + rk3506-evb.dts).
0001-rockchip-rk3506-add-AES-RK3506B-board-support-DT-def.patch
# SFC: sampling delay-line tuning (vendor port, mirror of linux 0002) so U-Boot
# reads the kernel FIT reliably + SFC_CTRL_WPEN per transfer (vendor parity) +
# dts SFC node (80MHz + max-dll). U-Boot only READS the kernel FIT (reliable
# with DLL tuning); WPEN is belt-and-suspenders.
0002-spi-rockchip_sfc-DLL-tuning-WPEN-dts-SFC-node.patch
# Autoboot: env=nowhere → compiled-default bootcmd (mtd read + bootm) runs every
# boot, no hand-typed 3 lines. Board-verified boot-sdl-202606182124.
0003-uboot-autoboot-mtd-bootm.patch
